payload.ingredientsText:
supreme matcha green: sencha grønn te (34%), pin ho wild jade grønn te (32%), indisk grønn te (32%), matcha pulver (jeju island emerald) (2%);
clean matcha green: sencha grønn te (40%), fennikel (10%), løvetannrot (10%), lakrisrot, nesleblader, eterisk olje fra sitron aroma (6%), gurkemeierot, sitron hel (4%), sitronmyrt blad, matcha pulver (jeju island emerald) (2%);
mint matcha green: grønn te sencha (60%), grønnmynte (28%), åkermynte (10%), matcha pulver (jeju island emerald) (2%);
ginseng matcha green: jeju island sencha grønn te (50%), sitrongress, ingefærrot, lakrisrot, sitron vana tulsiblad, eterisk sitrongressoljearoma, matchapulver (jeju island emerald) (2%), rød ginsengrot (2%)
